{
  "name": "ux-modules-windows",
  "description": "C++ modules mixed with <windows.h> (0.0.12, issue #50): two module units whose global module fragments include <windows.h>, and a file that includes it and imports both, built by CMake with MSVC (cl.exe) and Ninja. Answers are right, and they stay fast while a person types in the importer and in a module unit that autosaves: every completion answered, diagnostics back within seconds (a report had them five or six seconds behind each keystroke), no restart (a crash counts as one), nothing set aside. The typing budgets are what the 4-vCPU Windows runner measured over its first rounds, with a margin: a completion there costs about 0.5 s even idle (clang parses the body against the 28 MB <windows.h> preamble and the module files; stock clangd has no preamble for such a file and parses every header for each request), and one clangd has not answered within mcppls's 1 s budget is answered by mcppls, so U5's p95 sits at 1.0 s whenever a twentieth of them land past it (0.79-1.00 s measured); its p95 budget is 1.1 s, and its engine share is 0.65, not ux-mcpp's 0.75: the runner measured 0.72-0.90 over its rounds, a fifth of the completions landing past the 1 s budget.",
  "prepare-environment": "msvc",
  "prepare": [
    [
      "cmake",
      "-S",
      ".",
      "-B",
      "build",
      "-G",
      "Ninja",
      "-DCMAKE_CXX_COMPILER=cl",
      "-DCMAKE_EXPORT_COMPILE_COMMANDS=ON"
    ],
    [
      "cmake",
      "--build",
      "build"
    ]
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "id": "S1",
      "kind": "status",
      "source": "cmake",
      "profile-kind": "build-toolchain",
      "state": "ready"
    },
    {
      "id": "C1",
      "kind": "diagnostics-empty",
      "file": "src/main.cpp",
      "timeout": 240
    },
    {
      "id": "C1-module-with-windows-h",
      "kind": "diagnostics-empty",
      "file": "src/files.cppm",
      "timeout": 240
    },
    {
      "id": "C2-hover-module-member",
      "kind": "hover-contains",
      "file": "src/main.cpp",
      "at": [
        8,
        28
      ],
      "expect": "entryNames",
      "timeout": 120
    },
    {
      "id": "C3-definition-into-module",
      "kind": "definition",
      "file": "src/main.cpp",
      "at": [
        8,
        28
      ],
      "expect": "src/files.cppm",
      "timeout": 60
    },
    {
      "id": "C4-windows-api",
      "kind": "hover-contains",
      "file": "src/main.cpp",
      "at": [
        10,
        6
      ],
      "expect": "SetLastError",
      "timeout": 60
    },
    {
      "id": "U3-idle",
      "kind": "latency",
      "phase": "idle",
      "rounds": 20,
      "requests": [
        {
          "kind": "completion",
          "name": "module-member",
          "file": "src/main.cpp",
          "at": [
            9,
            35
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "completion",
          "name": "windows-api",
          "file": "src/main.cpp",
          "at": [
            10,
            7
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "hover",
          "file": "src/main.cpp",
          "at": [
            8,
            28
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "definition",
          "file": "src/main.cpp",
          "at": [
            8,
            28
          ],
          "expect": "src/files.cppm"
        }
      ],
      "budget": {
        "completion.p95": 0.8,
        "hover.p95": 0.3,
        "definition.p95": 0.5,
        "engineShare": 0.9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "U5-typing-in-the-importer",
      "kind": "typing",
      "file": "src/main.cpp",
      "seconds": 60,
      "hz": 10,
      "completion-every-ms": 1000,
      "scripts": [
        {
          "line": 11,
          "text": "DWORD written = 0; HANDLE out = ::GetStdHandle(STD_OUTPUT_HANDLE); ::WriteConsoleW(out, L\"x\", 1, &writ"
        },
        {
          "line": 11,
          "text": "auto uptime = process.uptimeMilliseconds(); if (uptime > 0 && process.isCurr"
        },
        {
          "line": 11,
          "text": "for (const auto& name : directory.entryNames()) { ::OutputDebugStringW(name.c_s"
        },
        {
          "line": 11,
          "text": "SYSTEMTIME now {}; ::GetLocalTime(&now); std::wstring stamp = std::to_wstring(now.wHo"
        }
      ],
      "diagnostic-probe": {
        "line": 11,
        "text": "int ux_probe_typo = ux_undeclared_name;",
        "expect": "ux_undeclared_name"
      },
      "budget": {
        "firstOpenSeconds": 120,
        "p95": 1.1,
        "max": 3.0,
        "timeouts": 0,
        "restarts": 0,
        "filesSetAside": 0,
        "engineShare": 0.65,
        "diagnosticsRefresh": 4.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "U16-module-autosave",
      "kind": "typing",
      "file": "src/process.cppm",
      "seconds": 60,
      "hz": 10,
      "completion-every-ms": 1000,
      "autosave-idle-ms": 1000,
      "scripts": [
        {
          "line": 13,
          "text": "inline DWORD sessionId() { DWORD session = 0; ::ProcessIdToSessionId(::GetCurrentProcessId(), &sess"
        },
        {
          "line": 13,
          "text": "inline bool isElevated() { HANDLE token = nullptr; if (!::OpenProcessToken(::GetCurrentProcess(), TOKEN_QUERY, &tok"
        }
      ],
      "importer": {
        "file": "src/main.cpp",
        "line": 11,
        "text": "    directory."
      },
      "budget": {
        "firstOpenSeconds": 120,
        "p95": 1.0,
        "max": 3.0,
        "timeouts": 0,
        "restarts": 0,
        "filesSetAside": 0,
        "stalled": 0,
        "importerP95": 1.5
      },
      "description": "While the module unit does not compile (half a statement autosaved), its importer keeps every other module (mcppls-clangd 0.0.13, partial-prerequisite-modules) and clangd serves it: each autosave changes the unit, so the importer's next request builds it again, and fails. The budget holds how fast the answers come, in both files, not what the importer's hold on the failed module's names (keeping the last BMI that built is for a later version)."
    },
    {
      "id": "STRESS1",
      "kind": "stress",
      "seed": 13,
      "actions": 60,
      "requestTimeout": 65,
      "files": [
        "src/*.cppm",
        "src/*.cpp"
      ],
      "budget": {
        "timeouts": 0,
        "p90": 5,
        "maxStallSeconds": 45,
        "rssMB": 3000
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "R1-no-crash-no-restart",
      "kind": "report",
      "timeout": 10,
      "expect": [
        {
          "path": "/roots/0/engines/*/details/restarts",
          "max-items": 0
        },
        {
          "path": "/roots/0/engines/*/details/filesSetAside",
          "max-items": 0
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "failure-log-lines": "Textual module preamble|replay differs|scan memo declined|scan manifest probe boundary|Built preamble of size"
}
